      "title": "Relight a photo with Qwen Image Edit 2509 and the Relight LoRA",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Relight a photo with Qwen Image Edit 2509 and the Relight LoRA\n\nRelights one photo from a direction, a softness, a color and a brightness written into one instruction, with the Relight LoRA and its trigger word. This file holds the 4-step row with the Lightning LoRA. The 40-step row leaves the Lightning LoRA out.\n\n## Models\n\n- [qwen_image_edit_2509_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-Edit_ComfyUI/resolve/main/split_files/diffusion_models/qwen_image_edit_2509_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors): Qwen Image Edit 2509, fp8, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen-Image-Edit-2509).\n- [qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/HunyuanVideo_1.5_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/text_encoders/qwen_2.5_vl_7b_fp8_scaled.safetensors): Qwen2.5-VL 7B text encoder, fp8, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen2.5-VL-7B-Instruct).\n- [qwen_image_vae.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI/resolve/main/split_files/vae/qwen_image_vae.safetensors): Qwen Image VAE, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image_ComfyUI).\n- [Qwen-Image-Edit-2509-Lightning-4steps-V1.0-bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/lightx2v/Qwen-Image-Lightning/resolve/main/Qwen-Image-Edit-2509/Qwen-Image-Edit-2509-Lightning-4steps-V1.0-bf16.safetensors): Qwen Image Edit 2509 Lightning 4-step LoRA, by lightx2v, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/lightx2v/Qwen-Image-Lightning).\n- [Qwen-Image-Edit-2509-Relight.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-Edit_ComfyUI/resolve/main/split_files/loras/Qwen-Image-Edit-2509-Relight.safetensors): Qwen Image Edit 2509 Relight LoRA, by dx8152, [Apache-2.0](https://huggingface.co/dx8152/Qwen-Image-Edit-2509-Relight).\n\nRosesfield ships no weights. Each loader lists its file with a download link.\n\nPart of [Rosesfield](https://github.com/rossaai/rosesfield), MIT. Built from Comfy-Org/workflow_templates, MIT, per NOTICE."
